275 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E ( The Formula Electric was one project that helped me build a lot of character. It was in its nascent stage during our time & most of the systems & processes had to be built from scratch. Our batch was instrumental in the design, selection & procurement of the cells, motor & controllers for the first prototype. But shortly after COVID hit bring everything to a stand still. Since then I have mostly helped the incoming batches with knowledge transfer as we occasionally visiting the workshop to track progress, understand the challenges they face & advising them with the experience I had)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
